DERIVED DATA
The policy inventory, the evidence appraisal database, the executed query
strings, and the screening decisions are released under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

Underlying bibliographic metadata originates from PubMed/MEDLINE (public
domain, courtesy of the U.S. National Library of Medicine) and Europe PMC. NLM
does not endorse or claim responsibility for any derived work.

This repository contains no full-text articles. Publisher PDFs used during
appraisal are excluded by .gitignore; every source is identified by DOI or PMID
so that readers can obtain it through their own access.
